{"book":"zhongyong","id":"sishu.zhongyong.30","index":30,"passages":[{"editorial_status":"unverified-draft","id":"sishu.zhongyong.30.01","number":1,"ruby_paragraphs":[[{"pinyin":"zhòng","traditional":"仲","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"ní","traditional":"尼","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"zǔ","traditional":"祖","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"shù","traditional":"述","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"尧","pinyin":"yáo","traditional":"堯","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"shùn","traditional":"舜","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"modern":"宪","pinyin":"xiàn","traditional":"憲","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"zhāng","traditional":"章","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"wén","traditional":"文","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"wǔ","traditional":"武","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"。"},{"pinyin":"shàng","traditional":"上","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"lǜ","traditional":"律","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"tiān","traditional":"天","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"时","pinyin":"shí","traditional":"時","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"pinyin":"xià","traditional":"下","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"袭","pinyin":"xí","traditional":"襲","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"shuǐ","traditional":"水","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"tǔ","traditional":"土","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"。"}]],"translation_indonesian":"Zhong Ni - Tiong Ni meneruskan ajaran Yao (Giau) dan Sun, mengembangkan ajaran Raja Wen - Bun dan Bu; di atas sesuai dengan peredaran alam semesta, dan di bawah sesuai dengan air dan tanah."},{"editorial_status":"unverified-draft","id":"sishu.zhongyong.30.02","number":2,"ruby_paragraphs":[[{"pinyin":"pì","traditional":"辟","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"rú","traditional":"如","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"tiān","traditional":"天","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"dì","traditional":"地","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"zhī","traditional":"之","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"无","pinyin":"wú","traditional":"無","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"bù","traditional":"不","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"chí","traditional":"持","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"载","pinyin":"zài","traditional":"載","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"modern":"无","pinyin":"wú","traditional":"無","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"bù","traditional":"不","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"fù","traditional":"覆","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"帱","pinyin":"chóu","traditional":"幬","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"。"},{"pinyin":"pì","traditional":"辟","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"rú","traditional":"如","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"sì","traditional":"四","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"时","pinyin":"shí","traditional":"時","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"zhī","traditional":"之","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"错","pinyin":"cuò","traditional":"錯","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"xíng","traditional":"行","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"pinyin":"rú","traditional":"如","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"rì","traditional":"日","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"yuè","traditional":"月","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"zhī","traditional":"之","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"dài","traditional":"代","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"míng","traditional":"明","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"。"}]],"translation_indonesian":"Sebagai langit dan bumi tiada sesuatu yang tidak didukungnya dan tiada sesuatu yang tidak diteduhinya. Sebagai empat musim saling berganti, sebagai matahari dan bulan berseling memberi cahaya."},{"editorial_status":"unverified-draft","id":"sishu.zhongyong.30.03","number":3,"ruby_paragraphs":[[{"modern":"万","pinyin":"wàn","traditional":"萬","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"wù","traditional":"物","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"并","pinyin":"bìng","traditional":"並","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"yù","traditional":"育","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"ér","traditional":"而","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"bù","traditional":"不","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"xiāng","traditional":"相","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"hài","traditional":"害","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"。"},{"pinyin":"dào","traditional":"道","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"并","pinyin":"bìng","traditional":"並","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"xíng","traditional":"行","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"ér","traditional":"而","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"bù","traditional":"不","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"xiāng","traditional":"相","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"bèi","traditional":"悖","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"。"},{"pinyin":"xiǎo","traditional":"小","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"dé","traditional":"德","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"chuān","traditional":"川","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"liú","traditional":"流","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"；"},{"pinyin":"dà","traditional":"大","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"dé","traditional":"德","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"dūn","traditional":"敦","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"huà","traditional":"化","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"。"},{"pinyin":"cǐ","traditional":"此","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"tiān","traditional":"天","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"dì","traditional":"地","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"zhī","traditional":"之","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"suǒ","traditional":"所","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"yǐ","traditional":"以","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"为","pinyin":"wèi","traditional":"為","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"dà","traditional":"大","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"yě","traditional":"也","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"。"}]],"translation_indonesian":"Berlaksa wujud terpelihara dengan tidak saling mencelakakan, begitupun Jalan Suci terlaksana dengan tiada yang saling bertentangan. Kebajikan (langit dan bumi) kecil, Dia sebagai air sungai mengalir; besar, Dia membentuk dan melebur segala sesuatu. Inilah yang menjadikan kebesaran langit dan bumi. TENGAH SEMPURNA BAB XXX (Nabi Bagi Semua)"}],"source_file":"02 - Zhong Yong 中庸/30 - Bab XXIX - Nabi Penerus dan Penyempurna.md","title":"Bab XXIX — Nabi Penerus dan Penyempurna"}
